      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding? how can you even say that? there's nothing left to build on. it's not just a setback, it's a void. every time i try to find that \"strength\" you're talking about, i just feel more empty. it honestly feels like the universe is telling me that my story is over. it's just... heavy. so heavy. i don't want to rebuild. i just want it to stop.",
